2026-06-23 10:14:59,744 | AGENT | SecurityCompliance Agent answered: To meet the client's requirements, we can implement several security measures. For strict professional secrecy and confidentiality, our system already utilizes strict partitioning with logical isolation per client and per mission, as well as access controls that prevent cross-client circulation of data. Additionally, we use encryption in transit via TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest through AES-256, which further protects client data.

